  "content": "\n\n<p>由 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fowasp.umn.edu%252falexander\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Alexander Weimer</a> 制作 - \n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252fa0.ax%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">官网</a> ·\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/a0ax\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a> ·\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.linkedin.com%252fin%252falexander-weimer%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">LinkedIn</a> ·\n  <a href=\"https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=9cVn1s0AAAAJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Google Scholar</a> ·\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.researchgate.net%252fprofile%252fAlexander-Weimer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ResearchGate</a> ·\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252forcid.org%252f0009-0009-7313-138X\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ORCiD</a> ·\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fjyse.org%252farticles%252ferror-corrected-deep-learning-gregg-shorthand\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">文章</a></p>\n<h3>《动态村庄》是 Create 的扩展模组，添加了大量基于 Create 的村庄职业与建筑。<a href=\"https://github.com/sudoLev/DynamicVillageMod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/x2n2cv6/starongithub.png\" alt=\"star\"></a></h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/sudolev/DynamicVillageMod/assets/61996958/40b915c2-4707-4376-a1c0-5ec6a5a55bcc\" alt=\"banner\"></p>\n<h1>功能列表</h1>\n<p><strong>机械工程师</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>购买并出售 Create 的机械装置零件</li>\n<li>核心方块：蓝图桌</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>液压工程师</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>购买并出售 Create 的流体管理部件——管道、泵、潜水装备等</li>\n<li>核心方块：物品排放器</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>列车机械师</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>购买并出售 Create 的列车系统部件</li>\n<li>核心方块：火车站</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>矿工</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>购买并出售 Create 的采矿设备，以及矿物/金属</li>\n<li>核心方块：机械钻机</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>共计 20 种平原、热带草原、沙漠、针叶林和雪地村庄建筑</h3>\n<h1>参与贡献</h1>\n<p><strong>感谢 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/ben001109/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">@Ben001109</a> 将《动态村庄》移植至 1.20.1！</strong> 🎉</p>\n<h3>错误报告、建议与想法</h3>\n<p>错误报告、建议与想法非常有价值，我们十分感激。您可通过创建 GitHub Issue 与我们取得联系。</p>\n<h3>翻译支持</h3>\n<p>非常感谢各位的翻译协助。最佳方式是提交 GitHub Issue 或 Pull Request。</p>\n<p><strong>感谢 <a href=\"https://github.com/EDGW\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">@EDGW</a> 将《动态村庄》翻译成简体中文。</strong> 🎉</p>\n<p><strong>感谢 <a href=\"https://github.com/Khaogamermain01\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Khao</a> 将《动态村庄》翻译成泰语。</strong> 🎉</p>\n<p><strong>感谢 <a href=\"https://github.com/RemVan\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">@RemVan</a> 将《动态村庄》翻译成俄语。</strong> 🎉</p>\n<h3>在 <a href=\"https://github.com/sudoLev/DynamicVillageMod/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a> 或 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fdynamic-village%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a> 上查看《动态村庄》</h3>\n<h4>在此<a href=\"https://github.com/sudoLev/DynamicVillageMod/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">报告问题</a></h4>\n<p><a href=\"https://url-shortener.curseforge.com/5srLQ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/4tvGCgv/dynamicvillage.png\" alt=\"Dynamic Village Banner\"></a></p>",
